## Modifications

The original BF16 safetensors weights were converted to ONNX and quantized to
int4 (block size 32, accuracy level 4) with the ONNX Runtime GenAI model builder
for on-device inference. No fine-tuning or weight merging was performed.
The conversion is a derivative work distributed under the same Apache-2.0 terms.

## Runtime

ONNX Runtime GenAI (Android AAR / Java-Kotlin API). The model package is intended
to run locally on Android arm64-v8a; no network calls are required at inference.

## Evaluation data attribution

Punctuation evaluation uses sentences from Tatoeba Russian sentences
(https://tatoeba.org), licensed CC-BY 2.0 FR. See
`data/postproc/punct_eval.jsonl` and `reports/data_eval/POSTPROC_EVAL_SPEC.md`.
Correction evaluation uses `data/test` references (CC-BY-4.0 / MIT, see
`data/test/manifest.jsonl`).

